{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S03、S11等较短段落中，话语和感受词过于密集，即使感受字较小且分时出现，观众仍容易来不及扫读；X的左右分区反而更便于快速浏览。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过关键词放大加亮，让观众更容易抓住每段心理变化的核心，而且人物为什么矛盾、为什么反复动摇，交代得更明确。它对音乐的节奏、音色、力度、身体感受和情绪转折也有更细致的描述，分时出现进一步增强了音乐与文字的对应关系。虽然部分短段落的阅读负担明显偏重，但整体上Y更能让观众理解人物、跟住情绪，并感受到音乐细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bbcf67c5-07e9-499d-a3e1-8e1d16f68b28", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002707878742Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.657, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:28:03.546359+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ecae0b9ca9297e6660609951a296c79c541d138d8cc5919b9119be3d7a045342", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen